{# Derived from sections 1-4, placed below the human case law (wassname, v3 review: derived material goes below the quotes from human society). Each item names its sources and shows the derivation, so these double as worked examples of applying the core (wassname 2026-10-08: "perhaps these will themslves serve as examples of how to work and apply the principles"). #}
